      "mapping_notes": [
        "Complete publisher-edition poem (PTS/BJTS), not a line-complete translation of every VRI stanza. Retain both authentic editions and all explicit differences; no missing words, numbers or line alignment are inferred.",
        "Explicit reviewed mapping: publisher chapter-3 poem 60 corresponds to canonical tha-ap62 by complete title, story and colophon evidence. Shared poem numbers or a numeric offset do not establish other mappings.",
        "Complete poem in the publisher PTS/BJTS-based edition, not a line-complete translation of bundled VRI. Preserve source wording, variants, colophons, printed numbering and note ownership; do not infer individual line alignment.",
        "The publisher prints the stock closing in full; VRI retains a peyyala abbreviation at the final numbered stanza. This is original publisher wording, not application-generated expansion.",
        "All seven definitions belong to the poem; chapter summary and closing chapter label own zero notes. Original botanical alternatives in note1 and awkward compound explanation in note2 remain translator apparatus.",
        "Separate chapter summary begins after the poem legend. It maps to canonical root blocks4238\u20134243, refs tha-ap62/19\u201321, including chapter colophon4238. Publisher places summary before chapter closing, VRI places chapter closing before summary. Preserve both original orders.",
        "The summary states92; VRI numbered stanzas span1\u201392, but physical publisher entries total91 because divisions differ in poem58. A chapter total is not proof of line-complete VRI translation.",
        "Source Asana botanical identities and source summary short-name forms remain exact; no reconciliation of multiple botanical identifications or renaming of neighboring poems is authorized."
      ],
